            <ArticleTitle>[Arthroscopic dorsal ligamento capsulodesis results in Geissler grade 2 and 3 scapholunate interosseous ligament injuries].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>6-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
